# condor_submit_dag sweep_components.dag : the decade at 4096 px (60 rings, MAGNETOGRAM of settings_components.sh) with
# the area threshold method, the time series of its parts simulated one by one (spot, plage, network alone; spot +
# plage, spot + plage + network) for every spot bisector of bisectors_components.txt and every line of
# parameters_components.txt (noise_th, I_th, A_th, Temp), everything in ${BASE}/components:
#   0. the lists of the jobs, without the comments of the two files (SCRIPT PRE jobs_components.sh)
#   1. the grids of every Temp, one job per bisector (build_grids_components.sub)                  } at the same time
#   2. identification in 80 blocks of days, plage and plage+network at once (identify_components.sub)  }
#   3. the days still missing, the filling factors of every set and of its parts (aggregate_components.sub)
#   4. one job per line and bisector: the simulation of the 5 parts, stats.json of the totals (run_components.sub)
#   5. tables and figures of the totals, per bisector (collect_components.sub; it runs even if some sets failed)
JOB grids     build_grids_components.sub
JOB ident     identify_components.sub
JOB aggregate aggregate_components.sub
JOB sets      run_components.sub
JOB collect   collect_components.sub
SCRIPT PRE grids /bin/bash jobs_components.sh
PARENT ident CHILD aggregate
PARENT grids aggregate CHILD sets
PARENT sets  CHILD collect
SCRIPT POST ident /bin/true
SCRIPT POST sets  /bin/true
